# TypeWeaver Todo API

This starter is an executable TypeWeaver contract with five Todo operations, shared errors, and
client generation.

## Start

```sh
pnpm install
pnpm validate
pnpm generate
pnpm typecheck
```

The source contract lives in `api/spec/`. Generated files are written to `api/generated/`; change
the spec and regenerate instead of editing generated output.

Use `pnpm doctor` to inspect the local runtime, project configuration, and contract without
modifying project files.
